// a valid signature from a signer that isn't trusted. Every other fault fails verification.
//
// The certificates below are throwaway self-signed ones (public part only - no private key
// exists), generated with .NET's CertificateRequest :
//   - "DPM Test Self-Signed Code Signing" : code signing EKU, valid 2026-01-01 .. 2046-01-01
//   - "DPM Test Expired Code Signing"     : code signing EKU, valid 2020-01-01 .. 2021-01-01
//   - "DPM Test Server Auth Only"         : server authentication EKU only, valid 2026 .. 2046
//   - "DPM Test Self-Signed Timestamping" : critical time stamping EKU, valid 2026 .. 2046

